<section class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-32" aria-label="Our approach">
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-mega text-oxblood">04 — Our approach</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl md:text-[3.6rem] font-light leading-[1.02]">
        Comfort is architecture you feel.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-[15px] md:text-base leading-relaxed text-smoke">
        Noor Chair is a Delhi seating studio with a simple belief: the chair is the most-used
        object in any working room, so it deserves the most thought. We study posture, daylight,
        heat and the way Indian homes and offices actually live — then curate seating concepts
        around them.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-md text-[15px] md:text-base leading-relaxed text-smoke">
        What we won't do: invent factory stories, fake certifications or inflated customer
        counts. What we will do: help you sit well, and confirm stock and delivery honestly
        before you pay a rupee.
      </p>
      <a href="/story" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink px-7 py-3.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ivory transition hover:bg-oxblood">
        Our story →
      </a>
      <dl class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 border-t border-line pt-6">
        <div><dt class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light">100+</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-smoke">Seating concepts</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light">6</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-smoke">Collections</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light">1</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-smoke">Delhi studio</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:gap-5">
      <img src="/images/story.jpg" alt="Warm minimal interior with designer chair" loading="lazy" class="img-warm col-span-2 h-[300px] md:h-[420px] w-full rounded-2xl object-cover" />
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524758631624-e2822e304c36?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Architectural office with wooden desks" loading="lazy" class="img-warm h-[220px] md:h-[280px] w-full rounded-2xl object-cover" />
      <img src="/images/craft.jpg" alt="Chair detail in styled neutral interior" loading="lazy" class="img-warm h-[220px] md:h-[280px] w-full rounded-2xl object-cover" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
